			<i>is echoed</i> by them, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1145
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀλλήλαις μέλος</span>
